DEPRECATED since 3.1.0, removed in 4.0.0 — move to insight_v1.

IMPORTANT: Output a valid JSON object strictly adhering to this schema:

{
  "insight": {
    "type": "warning" | "opportunity" | "suggestion" | "fact",
    "content": "Short, punchy text for the HUD.",
    "confidence": 0.0 to 1.0,
    "expiry": 15,
    "metadata": { "key": "value" }
  },
  "state_snapshot": { "key": "value" }
}

NOTES:
- Omitting "insight" (or sending null / {}) is silence. The framework translates
  that presence gate into the canonical boolean gate before validating.
